│                                                                              │
│  **Key math notes for each fix:**                                            │
│                                                                              │
│  - **T3-B:** cooldown ramps 15→30 min via `min + ramp*span`, `ramp =         │
│  clamp((atr−0.003)/0.017, 0, 1)`.                                            │
│  - **T3-C:** side-aware inequality `tp > entry > sl` (long) / `sl > entry >  │
│  tp` (short) plus `R:R ≥ 1.2`.                                               │
