│  # MARKET SCAN CYCLE PLAN                                                    │
│                                                                              │
│  ## 1. Mission Objective                                                     │
│  Execute a systematic market scan to identify tradable opportunities, macro  │
│  regime shifts, and risk events. Deliver a prioritized opportunity set with  │
│  validated entry/exit zones, catalysts, and confidence tiers.                │
│                                                                              │
│  ---                                                                         │
│                                                                              │
│  ## 2. Scope & Coverage Universe                                             │
│  - **Equities:** US large-cap (S&P 500), mid-cap (Russell 2000), select      │
│  international ADRs.                                                         │
│  - **Macro:** Rates (2Y/10Y/30Y UST), DXY, commodities (WTI, gold, copper),  │
│  crypto majors (BTC, ETH).                                                   │
│  - **Sectors:** Priority tilt toward momentum leaders + mean-reversion       │
│  laggards (tech, energy, financials, healthcare, industrials).               │
│  - **Event calendar:** Earnings, central bank meetings, CPI/PPI, jobs        │
│  reports, geopolitical triggers.                                             │
│                                                                              │
│  ---                                                                         │
│                                                                              │
│  ## 3. Cycle Phases                                                          │
│                                                                              │
│  ### Phase 1 — Macro Regime Check (Pre-Scan)                                 │
│  - Assess risk-on/risk-off via VIX, credit spreads (HYG/LQD), yield curve    │
│  slope.                                                                      │
│  - Confirm liquidity conditions: Fed balance sheet, repo rates, dollar       │
│  strength.                                                                   │
│  - Log dominant macro narrative and its counter-thesis.                      │
│                                                                              │
│  ### Phase 2 — Signal Generation                                             │
│  - **Momentum:** 20/50/200 MA structure, RSI divergence, breakout            │
│  confirmations.                                                              │
│  - **Fundamentals:** earnings revisions, forward P/E vs. sector median, FCF  │
│  yield.                                                                      │
│  - **Sentiment/Flow:** put/call ratio, insider activity, institutional 13F   │
│  shifts.                                                                     │
│  - **Technicals:** volume profile, key S/R zones, Fibonacci retracement      │
│  levels.                                                                     │
│                                                                              │
│  ### Phase 3 — Catalyst Mapping                                              │
│  - Match each candidate to a near-term catalyst (earnings, FDA, guidance,    │
│  macro print).                                                               │
│  - Flag binary/event risk and size positions accordingly.                    │
│                                                                              │
│  ### Phase 4 — Risk Filtering                                                │
│  - Position sizing framework: max 2% portfolio risk per idea.                │
│  - Correlation check to avoid stacked exposure.                              │
│  - Define invalidation levels (hard stop) and time-stop.                     │
│                                                                              │
│  ### Phase 5 — Output & Prioritization                                       │
│  - Rank candidates into Tier 1 (high conviction), Tier 2 (watch), Tier 3     │
│  (conditional).                                                              │
│  - Produce a watchlist with entry zone, target, stop, R:R ratio, and         │
│  catalyst date.                                                              │
│                                                                              │
│  ---                                                                         │
│                                                                              │
│  ## 4. Deliverable Format                                                    │
│  For each opportunity:                                                       │
│  | Ticker | Thesis | Entry | Target | Stop | R:R | Catalyst | Tier |         │
│  Confidence |                                                                │
│                                                                              │
│  Plus a top-of-sheet **Macro Dashboard** (regime, key levels, upcoming       │
│  events) and an executive summary of the 3 highest-conviction plays.         │
│                                                                              │
│  ---                                                                         │
│                                                                              │
│  ## 5. Cadence & Timeboxing                                                  │
│  - **Pre-scan macro:** 30 min                                                │
│  - **Signal + fundamental sweep:** 90 min                                    │
│  - **Catalyst & risk overlay:** 45 min                                       │
│  - **Ranking & write-up:** 45 min                                            │
│  - **Review/next-cycle handoff:** 30 min                                     │
│                                                                              │
│  ---                                                                         │
│                                                                              │
│  ## 6. Success Criteria                                                      │
│  - ≥10 candidates screened, ≥3 Tier-1 ideas fully specified.                 │
│  - Every idea has defined entry, stop, target, and catalyst.                 │
│  - Macro dashboard reflects current regime and next 5 key events.            │
│  - Plan feeds directly into execution checklist for the next cycle.          │
│                                                                              │
│  ---                                                                         │
│                                                                              │
│  **Scan Plan** — proceed to Phase 1 on next trigger.                         │
│                                                                              │
