│  recorded as a **LOSER**. That is a look-ahead-ambiguous /                   │
│  intrabar-ordering bias that systematically understates winners.             │
│  - There is **no trail, no breakeven move, no partial scale-out.** Once      │
│  price touches TP1 the whole position is closed; the concept of "runner to   │
│  TP2" does not exist in code.                                                │
│                                                                              │
│  ### Flaw G — Gap risk and the exit bar are ignored                          │
│  The exit only inspects the *current* bar's high/low against static levels.  │
