│  ATR.                                                                        │
│    * Remainder runs to a trailing stop, TP2, a gap, or a time stop.          │
│                                                                              │
│  Intrabar ordering                                                           │
│  -----------------                                                           │
│  When a single bar's range covers both the stop and a target we apply a      │
│  deliberate, documented PESSIMISTIC rule: assume the STOP is hit first       │
│  (unless the bar gapped open beyond a level, in which case the fill is at    │
│  the OPEN). This removes optimistic same-bar look-ahead bias.                │
│                                                                              │
│  Outcome is recorded as a real R-multiple (weighted across the scale-out),   │
│  and WINNER / LOSER labels are derived from total_R > 0.                     │
│                                                                              │
│  Requires: pandas, mplfinance, requests. numpy is imported for convenience.  │
│  """                                                                         │
